  m_text: 'Thanks for downloading FPS ENGINE Beta!


    Move around: WASD / L joystick

    Look
    Around: Mouse / R joystick

    Jump: Space / South Button

    Reload: R / West
    Button

    Melee Attack: F / R3 (R press)

    Crouch: Left Control / Easy Button

    Sprint:
    Left Shift / L3 (L hold or press)

    Dash: Mouse Wheel Press

    Fire: Left
    click / Right trigger

    Change weapon slot: Scroll wheel / Bumpers

    Aim:
    Right Click / Left trigger

    Interact: E / North Button

    Drop Weapon:
    G / Select [Gamepad]

    Pause: Esc/Start'
